    pk:hypothesisType "Kirchhoff Elastic Rod Hamiltonian Mechanics, Zero-Link Topological Conservation (ΔLk = 0), Pitchfork Bifurcation & G-Fiber Overwinding" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 5.54e-01 .

