<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion & G-fiber overwinding — Model fidelity to source: 58/100" ;
