<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion & G-fiber overwinding — MorphoEval overall 55.4/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py` (overall weighted score: 56.2/100). The baseline computes the analytical critical pitchfork tension T_c = B*kappa_0^2/(1+Gamma) and integrates a kinematic tanh(s/xi) perversion centerline, but lacks L-BFGS-B energy minimization of the discrete Kirchhoff elastic rod potential functional, lacks Gerbode et al.'s (2012) soft-young (Gamma = 0.25) vs mature-lignified (Gamma = 1.45) overwinding validation, omits the 4-species climbing plant comparison, and does not segment the vendored Passiflora caerulea specimen image. Overall 55.4/100 (faithfulness 52.0, reproducibility 63.5); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 46, Parameter expressivity 52, Morphometric validation 54, Source and data traceability 68, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature_comparison.png: rendered output of 1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py at 8871db0, image/png, 124938 B, 1122×561 px, artifact_sha256 4031af6d289a50a4062f9e99cb70f5bd44044d27250bf245845f5d9949c8b07d (sha256 4031af6d289a50a4062f9e99cb70f5bd44044d27250bf245845f5d9949c8b07d), spec_fingerprint 81dfb3e9af1997e6ab25d20a9df9a7e1c95cc098270169bcb2bef6a18286dabb. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 81dfb3e9af1997e6ab25d20a9df9a7e1c95cc098270169bcb2bef6a18286dabb; artifact_sha256: 4031af6d289a50a4062f9e99cb70f5bd44044d27250bf245845f5d9949c8b07d; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature/paper_citations.bib=f0760535ef74775e..., datasets/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature/scout_manifest.json=801e196968b34405..., datasets/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature/tendril_perversion_helix_specimen.jpg=14409d193142442d..., datasets/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature_reference.json=8af7ac3175f6890f...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Enforce runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 dataset files, expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 quantitative reference-anchored metrics, and upgrade the figure to a 6-panel synthesis layout.",
        "remediation needed: Implement Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Fig. 3D-E axial extension overwinding analysis comparing young soft tendrils (Gamma = C/B = 0.25, peak overwinding +0.58 turns) against mature lignified tendrils (Gamma = 1.45, monotonic unwinding) and validate across 4 climbing plant species.",
        "remediation needed: Implement a variational L-BFGS-B energy minimizer for the Kirchhoff elastic rod potential energy functional E[theta(s)] with intrinsic curvature kappa_0 and G-fiber bilayer strain-to-curvature mechanics, plus zero-curvature (kappa_0 = 0) and super-critical tension (T >= T_c) negative controls.",
        "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision segmentation of `datasets/tendril_perversion_intrinsic_curvature/tendril_perversion_helix_specimen.jpg` (*Passiflora caerulea* coiled tendril) isolating the tendril backbone, opposite-handed helical turns, and central perversion inversion kink." ;
    pk:hasScore 5.54e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

